---
description: Stepwise commits on workstream branches — do not wait to be asked
alwaysApply: true
---

**Commit discipline (hard):** On `agent/<work-id>`, commit after each meaningful step **without waiting for the human to ask**. The dedicated work branch is the safety boundary; kit policy overrides global “only commit when asked.” Still require explicit human direction for push, force-push, amend of pushed commits, and merges to `main`/`master`.

Canonical policy: `_ask/policies/worktree.md`. Checklist: root `AGENTS.md`.
